ace-nowrap max-[1021px]:hidden max-mobile:block group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:hidden" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="/quote/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-nav font-extrabold group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small max-mobile:w-full group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:px-3">Get a Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <script type="module">const t=document.querySelector(".mobile-toggle"),n=document.querySelector("#nav-links");t?.addEventListener("click",()=>{const s=n?.classList.toggle("open")??!1;t.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(s))});document.addEventListener("click",s=>{const e=s.target;if(!(e instanceof Node))return;const o=document.querySelector(".nav-services");o?.open&&!o.contains(e)&&(o.open=!1),n?.classList.contains("open")&&!n.contains(e)&&!t?.contains(e)&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"))});document.addEventListener("keydown",s=>{if(s.key!=="Escape")return;const e=document.querySelector(".nav-services");e?.open?(e.open=!1,e.querySelector("summary")?.focus()):n?.classList.contains("open")&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),t instanceof HTMLElement&&t.focus())});</script> <main id="main-content" class="scroll-mt-20" tabindex="-1">   <section class="border-b border-line bg-mist pt-[56px] pb-[54px] max-mobile:pt-9 max-mobile:pb-10"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <p class="mb-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sea-dark">FAQ</p> <h1 class="max-w-[860px] text-page-title font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em]">Questions before you book?</h1> <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lede mt-[18px]">Here are the things people usually want to know about pricing, supplies, access, scheduling, and what’s included.</p> </div> </section> <section class="py-section max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] max-w-[900px]"> <div class="grid gap-3"> <details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What should I do before you arrive?</summary> <p class="mt-3">You don’t need to clean first. Pick up loose items, clothing, and toys, and clear dishes from the sink so we can reach the surfaces and floors. Tell us about pets, delicate surfaces, or product preferences. We’ll arrange access ahead of time. If cabinet interiors are included in your clean, empty them before we arrive.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What isn’t included in a standard home clean?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Standard cleaning covers reachable surfaces. Baseboard and trim detailing are part of a deep clean. Appliance interiors, empty cabinet interiors, and interior windows are optional extras. Moving heavy furniture or appliances, organizing clutter, washing dishes, and laundry are outside the standard home-cleaning checklist. Rental laundry and restocking can be arranged separately.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Does requesting a quote book an appointment?</summary> <p class="mt-3">No. Sending the form starts the conversation. We’ll follow up about the cleaning, price, and available dates, and confirm the appointment separately.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What should I tell you before the visit?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Tell us about your priorities, pets, delicate surfaces, and product preferences. If you’ll be out, arrange secure access before the appointment. For move-out cleaning, let us know if furniture or belongings will remain.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50" open> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">How is pricing determined?</summary> <div class="mt-4"> <dl class="divide-y divide-line"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-4 py-3 max-[400px]:grid-cols-1 max-[400px]:gap-1"> <dt class="font-bold">Home cleaning</dt> <dd class="m-0 text-sea-dark tabular-nums">From $125 per visit</dd> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-4 py-3 max-[400px]:grid-cols-1 max-[400px]:gap-1"> <dt class="font-bold">Deep cleaning</dt> <dd class="m-0 text-sea-dark tabular-nums">From $275 per visit</dd> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-4 py-3 max-[400px]:grid-cols-1 max-[400px]:gap-1"> <dt class="font-bold">Move-in / move-out</dt> <dd class="m-0 text-sea-dark tabular-nums">From $350 per visit</dd> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-4 py-3 max-[400px]:grid-cols-1 max-[400px]:gap-1"> <dt class="font-bold">Vacation rentals</dt> <dd class="m-0 text-sea-dark tabular-nums">From $125 per turnover</dd> </div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-4 py-3 max-[400px]:grid-cols-1 max-[400px]:gap-1"> <dt class="font-bold">Commercial cleaning</dt> <dd class="m-0 text-sea-dark tabular-nums">Custom quote</dd> </div> </dl> <p class="mt-4">Starting prices give you a ballpark. We’ll confirm the actual price before you book based on the property, its condition, cleaning frequency, and any extras you want. Deep cleans and move cleans may require photos or additional details for an accurate quote.</p> </div> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Do I need to be home?</summary> <p class="mt-3">No. You’re welcome to be home, but you don’t have to be. If you’ll be out, we’ll agree on secure property access before the appointment.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Do you bring supplies?</summary> <p class="mt-3">We bring standard cleaning supplies and equipment. If you have delicate surfaces or specific product preferences, let us know before the visit.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What if I have pets?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Pets are welcome. If your pet may become anxious, act aggressively, or get in the way, please keep them in a secure area during the clean.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What’s the difference between standard and deep cleaning?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Standard cleaning covers kitchen and bathroom surfaces, reachable dusting, floors, and trash. A deep clean adds attention to buildup and detail work, including baseboards, reachable trim, fans, and window tracks. Appliance interiors, cabinet interiors, and interior window glass are quoted separately with either service.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Can I request a standard clean without add-ons?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Yes. Choose Home Cleaning and leave the optional extras unchecked. Standard cleaning covers kitchen and bathroom surfaces, reachable dusting, floors, trash removal, and a basic room reset. We’ll confirm the price for your home and available dates before booking.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Can you handle linens and restocking for rentals?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Have clean linens ready for each turnover. Laundry and supply restocking are quoted separately by arrangement. We’ll confirm where supplies are stored, what needs restocking, and any laundry arrangements before service starts.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">What if something needs attention after the cleaning?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Call or text us and tell us what needs attention. We’ll review it with you against the agreed checklist and discuss the next step.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">How do I cancel or reschedule?</summary> <p class="mt-3">Call or text us as soon as you know your plans have changed. Any cancellation or lockout terms will be confirmed before you book.</p> </details> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-[66px] max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-10"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.8rem)]">Need a cleaner?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Tell us what you need cleaned and when you need it. We’ll work through the details with you and confirm the price before anything is booked.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-white text-sea-dark hover:bg-mist active:bg-seafoam min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-act